{
    "version": 1,
    "description": "Манифест целей генератора (DESIGN §3.2). Пути output - относительно корня репо/установки ($ZEPHYRINE_ROOT); ~ - домашний каталог. stage != v1 - заглушка будущего этапа.",
    "fields": {
        "kind": "template|patch|data|emit|command",
        "deploy": "none | copy:<путь> | obsidian-vaults | zen-profile | tb-profile | tb-xpi",
        "reload": "none | hypr-reload | kitty-usr1 | hypridle-restart | mpvpaper-restart | gsettings",
        "detect": "{type: always|command|file}; не найдено -> skipped (не ошибка)",
        "golden": "участвует в golden-тесте (false для emit/patch/command)",
        "keys": "ключи settings, влияющие на цель (выбор целей при set); keysLater - ключи будущих этапов",
        "patches": "только kind=patch: список правок отдельных ключей файла (zsettings/patch.py: type ini|line, from, value, tail, sizeFrom, forbid); deployPatches - то же только для живой копии"
    },
    "stateDir": "~/.local/state/zephyrine",
    "profileDiscovery": {
        "rule": "<root>/installs.ini -> первая строка 'Default=' -> <root>/<значение>; как в deploy.sh",
        "examples": {
            "zen": "~/.config/zen/smhkr7xv.Default (release)",
            "thunderbird": "~/.config/thunderbird/<профиль>"
        }
    },
    "targets": [
        {
            "id": "quickshell",
            "kind": "data",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": null,
            "output": "quickshell/scheme.override.json",
            "deploy": "none",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "вживую (FileView в Colors.qml)",
            "detect": {
                "type": "always"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": true,
            "deployNote": "~/.config/quickshell/zephyrine - симлинк на quickshell/ репо; пишем в realpath",
            "defaultContent": "{\"colours\": {}}",
            "notes": "Только переопределённые ключи палитры (эффективное != scheme.json). Альфы/радиусы бар получает от Prefs (settings.json), не через этот файл.",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.quickshell"
        },
        {
            "id": "hypr",
            "kind": "emit",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": null,
            "output": ".config/hypr/settings.lua",
            "deploy": "none",
            "reload": "hypr-reload",
            "restart": "вживую",
            "detect": {
                "type": "command",
                "name": "hyprctl"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.windowRounding",
                "hypr.borders.style",
                "hypr.borders.size",
                "hypr.borders.custom",
                "hypr.glassOpacity",
                "input.layouts",
                "input.switchOption",
                "input.extraOptions",
                "input.repeatRate",
                "input.repeatDelay",
                "input.sensitivity",
                "input.touchpad.naturalScroll",
                "input.touchpad.tapToClick",
                "input.touchpad.tapAndDrag",
                "input.touchpad.disableWhileTyping",
                "input.touchpad.clickfinger",
                "input.touchpad.middleButtonEmulation",
                "input.touchpad.scrollFactor",
                "appearance.mode",
                "appearance.cursor.theme",
                "appearance.cursor.size"
            ],
            "golden": false,
            "deployNote": "~/.config/hypr - симлинк на .config/hypr репо",
            "reloadCmd": [
                "hyprctl",
                "reload",
                "config-only"
            ],
            "preCheck": [
                "luac -p <file>",
                "hyprctl repl (loadfile)"
            ],
            "postCheck": [
                "hyprctl configerrors пуст, иначе откат из бэкапа"
            ],
            "keysLater": [
                "display.monitors",
                "binds.*",
                "apps.terminal",
                "apps.fileManager",
                "autostart"
            ],
            "notes": "Эмиттер (hypr.py), без шаблона; подключается из hyprland.lua через pcall(dofile) (DESIGN §3.9). Цветовые значения рамок - не палитра (palette-roles.json: nonPalette).",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.hypr"
        },
        {
            "id": "gtk3",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/gtk/gtk3.css.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css",
            "deploy": "copy:~/.config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "новые окна; открытые GTK-приложения - перезапуск",
            "detect": {
                "type": "always"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.glassAlpha",
                "appearance.surfaceAlpha",
                "appearance.radius",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/gtk3/gtk.css",
            "notes": "Файл НЕ идентичен gtk-4.0/gtk.css: в gtk-3.0 есть дополнительный комментарий в конце (строки про window/.background) - отдельный шаблон на каждую цель.",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.gtk3"
        },
        {
            "id": "gtk4",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/gtk/gtk4.css.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/gtk-4.0/gtk.css",
            "deploy": "copy:~/.config/gtk-4.0/gtk.css",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "новые окна; открытые GTK-приложения - перезапуск",
            "detect": {
                "type": "always"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.glassAlpha",
                "appearance.surfaceAlpha",
                "appearance.radius",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/gtk4/gtk.css",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.gtk4"
        },
        {
            "id": "qt6ct",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/qt6ct/zephyrine.conf.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/qt6ct/colors/zephyrine.conf",
            "deploy": "copy:~/.config/qt6ct/colors/zephyrine.conf",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "перезапуск Qt-приложений (проверить, следит ли qt6ct за файлом)",
            "detect": {
                "type": "command",
                "name": "qt6ct"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/qt6ct/zephyrine.conf",
            "notes": "Формат #AARRGGBB (фильтр argb). Файл палитры не содержит абсолютных путей; путь color_scheme_path живёт в qt6ct.conf (цель qt6ct-conf).",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.qt6ct"
        },
        {
            "id": "zed",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/zed/zephyrine.json.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/zed/themes/zephyrine.json",
            "deploy": "none",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "Zed следит за themes/ (проверить)",
            "detect": {
                "type": "command",
                "name": "zeditor"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.glassAlpha",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/zed/zephyrine.json",
            "deployNote": "~/.config/zed - симлинк на .config/zed репо",
            "notes": "Эталон без финального \\n (json.dumps indent=2). Шаблон строго воспроизводит байты.",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.zed"
        },
        {
            "id": "kitty",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/kitty/zephyrine.conf.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/kitty/zephyrine.conf",
            "deploy": "none",
            "reload": "kitty-usr1",
            "restart": "вживую",
            "detect": {
                "type": "command",
                "name": "kitty"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/kitty/zephyrine.conf",
            "deployNote": "~/.config/kitty - симлинк на .config/kitty репо",
            "reloadCmd": [
                "pkill",
                "-USR1",
                "-x",
                "kitty"
            ],
            "notes": "kitty.conf подключает zephyrine.conf через include (строка 98).",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.kitty"
        },
        {
            "id": "zathura",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/zathura/zathurarc.tmpl",
            "output": ".config/zathura/zathurarc",
            "deploy": "none",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "перезапуск zathura или :source",
            "detect": {
                "type": "command",
                "name": "zathura"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.fonts.mono.family",
                "appearance.fonts.mono.size",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/zathura/zathurarc",
            "deployNote": "~/.config/zathura/zathurarc - симлинк на файл репо (сам каталог zathura - обычный)",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.zathura"
        },
        {
            "id": "obsidian",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/obsidian/theme.css.tmpl",
            "output": "obsidian/Zephyrine/theme.css",
            "deploy": "obsidian-vaults",
            "deployPath": "<vault>/.obsidian/themes/Zephyrine/theme.css",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "проверить live-перезагрузку темы; иначе Ctrl+R в Obsidian",
            "detect": {
                "type": "file",
                "path": "~/.config/obsidian/obsidian.json"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.glassAlpha",
                "appearance.surfaceAlpha",
                "appearance.radius",
                "appearance.fonts.mono.family",
                "appearance.fonts.shell.size",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/obsidian/theme.css",
            "deployExtra": [
                "obsidian/Zephyrine/manifest.json (статический, копируется рядом с theme.css; не шаблон)"
            ],
            "registry": "~/.config/obsidian/obsidian.json",
            "registryPath": "vaults.*.path",
            "notes": "Vault'ы сейчас на /mnt/data (NTFS/fuseblk) - может быть не смонтирован -> skipped. Нет <vault>/.obsidian -> skipped. appearance.json (включение темы) НЕ трогаем - это делает deploy.sh --obsidian-only. Нужны primaryHsl (palette-roles.json: strings).",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.obsidian"
        },
        {
            "id": "tb-css",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/thunderbird/userChrome.css.tmpl",
            "output": "thunderbird/userChrome.css",
            "deploy": "tb-profile",
            "deployPath": "<профиль TB>/chrome/userChrome.css",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "полный перезапуск Thunderbird",
            "detect": {
                "type": "file",
                "path": "~/.config/thunderbird/installs.ini"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.glassAlpha",
                "appearance.surfaceAlpha",
                "appearance.radius",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/tb-css/userChrome.css",
            "profile": {
                "root": "~/.config/thunderbird",
                "registry": "installs.ini",
                "key": "Default"
            },
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.tb-css"
        },
        {
            "id": "tb-theme",
            "kind": "template",
            "stage": "v1",
            "template": "templates/thunderbird/manifest.json.tmpl",
            "output": "thunderbird/zephyrine-theme/manifest.json",
            "deploy": "tb-xpi",
            "deployPath": "<профиль TB>/extensions/zephyrine-theme@zephyrine.xpi",
            "reload": "none",
            "restart": "полный перезапуск Thunderbird",
            "detect": {
                "type": "file",
                "path": "~/.config/thunderbird/installs.ini"
            },
            "keys": [
                "appearance.accent",
                "appearance.mode"
            ],
            "golden": "tests/golden/tb-theme/manifest.json",
            "xpi": {
                "format": "zip",
                "deflate": true,
                "members": [
                    {
                        "src": "output",
                        "name": "manifest.json"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "profile": {
                "root": "~/.config/thunderbird",
                "registry": "installs.ini",
                "key": "Default"
            },
            "versioning": {
                "field": "version",
                "base": "1.0",
                "counter": "generated.json:meta.tbVersion",
                "note": "golden идёт с N=0 -> \"1.0\"; при необходимости роста версии - 1.0.N (проверить, нужен ли рост)"
            },
            "notes": "Эталон manifest.json НЕ воспроизводится json.dumps (инлайн-объект gecko) - шаблон текстовый. Живая копия - manifest внутри xpi.",
            "manageKey": "appearance.targets.tb-theme"
        },
        {
